{"id":"n44878-4-3","stage":0,"title":"이것 · 这家伙","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n44878-4-3-1","ko":"이것이 제 아들 놈입니다.","zh":"这是我的儿子啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이것이","meaning":"这家伙","explanation":"이것：这家伙；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"4","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아들","meaning":"儿子","explanation":"아들：儿子","readings":[{"term":"아들","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20240","senseId":"1","lemma":"아들","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놈입니다.","meaning":"那家伙，那小子","explanation":"놈：那家伙，那小子；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"놈","audio":"/audio/8cb9618fb00ec4c42e61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74193","senseId":"4","lemma":"놈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这家伙","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"(昵称)这个孩子。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"65e567305972e652","term":"아들","zh":"儿子","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3","entryId":"20240","definition":"男性子女。","pronunciation":["아들"]},{"id":"8cb9618fb00ec4c4","term":"놈","zh":"那家伙，那小子","audio":"/audio/8cb9618fb00ec4c42e61.mp3","entryId":"74193","definition":"(谦词)(亲近)那个人。","pronunciation":["놈"]}],"audio":"/audio/945b6db88c7c65f81d41.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n44878-4-3-2","ko":"아버지를 닮아 잘 생겼네요.","zh":"长得真像他父亲，很帅呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아버지를","meaning":"父亲，